  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Passive in the Präteritum",
     "texto": [
      "It's formed with **wurde** (singular) or **wurden** (plural) and the participle at the end: **Die Heizung wurde gestern repariert** (the heating was repaired yesterday). The word order doesn't change: the conjugated verb goes in second position.",
      "In the plural: **Die Fenster wurden ausgetauscht** (the windows were replaced)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Passive Perfekt (just a heads-up)",
     "texto": [
      "In conversation you also hear **ist … worden**: **Die Heizung ist repariert worden** (the heating has been repaired). You'll see this later in the texts.",
      "Watch out: **worden** is the participle of «werden» and comes after the participle."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
